# ── Project-specific local-only docs ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Handover narrative and the documentation standard are local references,
# not artefacts of the Scintilla codebase itself.
HANDOVER.md
development_documentation.md

# ── Build output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
build-*/
out/
cmake-build-*/
install/

# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeScripts/
cmake_install.cmake
CTestTestfile.cmake
Testing/
_deps/
compile_commands.json
Makefile

